      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If I can add my two cents: knowing this limitation and the fact that, at least for me, I usually have name plates turned off for this exact reason, it boggles my mind that VRChat is planning to release custom name plate MTX.\n\nThis performance issue absolutely needs to be fixed before any cosmetics are even considered.",
