  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The old VRchat nameplates are well-known to degrade game performance when turned on, setting nameplates to hidden improves your performance by about 10fps on average. The new nameplate refresh does nothing to fix or otherwise improve this degradation, and I'd prefer that be prioritized.",
